---
// Para docs header brand. The splash's positioning is Lang + Runtime
// as two equal products (Lib pillar dropped 2026-05-06); docs are the
// shared reference for both. The wordmark borrows the splash's
// Fraunces treatment — same display face, scaled down for nav, with a
// muted ghost-halo that hints at the splash atmosphere without
// dominating the chrome.
//
// Earlier rev embedded a `nav-3body.js` orbital-mechanics canvas next
// to the wordmark, leftover from when Para had three pillars. That
// metaphor went away with the Lib demotion; the canvas + script went
// with it.
---

<a href="/" class="site-title sl-flex">
  <span class="brand-active">Para</span>
</a>

<style>
  .site-title {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    font-family: "Fraunces", Georgia, serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.018em;
    color: var(--pb-text);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-variation-settings:
      "opsz" 144,
      "SOFT" 30,
      "WONK" 1;
    /* Subtler than the splash wordmark's full halo — this lives in
       the nav chrome and shouldn't pull focus from page content. */
    text-shadow:
      0 0 12px color-mix(in srgb, var(--pb-ghost-blue) 18%, transparent),
      0 0 24px color-mix(in srgb, var(--pb-ghost-green) 10%, transparent);
  }
  .brand-active {
    color: var(--pb-text);
    font-weight: 700;
  }
</style>
